sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    actor C as Citizen Reporter
    actor A as Administrator
    participant API as FastAPI
    participant REPO as detection_repo
    participant FS as uploads/ (JSON + JPG)
    participant DB as Supabase
    participant DET as PotholeDetector

    rect rgb(235, 244, 255)
    Note over C,DB: Phase 1 - quick report, no ML (public endpoint)
    C->>API: POST /api/v1/submit (image, lat, lng, device_id)
    API->>API: validate Ghana bbox, image type, size <= 10 MB
    API->>REPO: save_submission(lat, lng, device_id, raw)
    REPO->>FS: save {id}.jpg
    REPO->>FS: record (confidence 0.0, detections [], status pending)
    opt Supabase configured
        REPO->>DB: INSERT row (fallback to base columns on error)
    end
    REPO-->>API: SubmitResponse
    API-->>C: 200 id, status pending, image_url
    end

    rect rgb(240, 253, 244)
    Note over A,DET: Phase 2 - deferred ML analysis
    A->>API: POST /api/v1/detections/{id}/analyze
    API->>REPO: get_detection_by_id(id)
    alt in local store
        FS-->>REPO: record
    else not local and Supabase configured
        REPO->>DB: SELECT * WHERE id = {id}
        DB-->>REPO: row (status / image_url defaulted if missing)
    end
    alt not found
        API-->>A: 404 Detection submission not found
    end
    API->>REPO: get_image_file_path(id)
    Note right of REPO: generates a placeholder JPG if file missing
    API->>DET: predict(img) in threadpool (or mock if model unavailable)
    DET-->>API: detections
    API->>REPO: update_detection_results(id, max_conf, detections, status)
    REPO->>FS: update record + JSON file
    opt Supabase configured
        REPO->>DB: UPDATE confidence, detections, status
    end
    API-->>A: 200 DetectionResponse (status confirmed or pending)
    end
